{"about_the_game":"Take part in an incredible magic school bowling tournament! <br>Immerse yourself in an amazing adventure, destroy the plans of the Crowly faculty  with your loyal feathered defenders. Use your skills to beat your opponents and lead your faculty to victory!  <br><br>Welcome to Owling. Crowling. Bowling! - realistic bowling simulator in a magical universe, created under the HTC Vive and/or Oculus Rift. <br>You will learn the history of the magic school tournament, which has become a tradition. Two faculties are fighting for the victory and the right to paint the club with their colors. <br>Magic is forbidden - you can rely only on your accuracy and luck. <br><br><strong>Game features: </strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Classic rules - everything is simple and familiar. <br></li><li> 2 type of balls with unique physical characteristics <br></li><li> Easy and intuitive controls<br></li><li> Record and save the results of each game <br></li><li> A unique story mode with a detective plot<br></li><li> Training mode<br></li><li> HTC Vive and Oculus Rift support <br></li><li> Steam Achievements</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1035210/extras/73bec92a38660bf12729d606bfeb41dc.avif?t=1747247807\" width=500 height=291 /></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1035210?t=1747247807","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1035210/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747247807","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1035210/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747247807","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1035210/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747247807","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"descript